  "body": "Simply the best - our vendors have met the market and are ready to move on! \r\n\r\nSet in the heart of Whangaparaoa, this lovely apartment is just a short stroll to bus stops, Whangaparaoa College, movie theatre, supermarket, gym, doctors, cafes, the list goes on - this is a prime location at an affordable price.\r\n\r\nPositioned as a desirable end unit on the top floor, this beautifully presented apartment offers exceptional natural light, privacy, and a secure residence. Owned by the same careful owner since new and maintained in great condition, this is effortless living at its best. \r\n\r\nThe open-plan living area feels light and airy year-round, enhanced by double glazing and excellent orientation to the sun.  Two generous bedrooms are well laid out, complemented by a tidy, modern bathroom, making this home ideal for owner-occupiers, downsizers, or investors alike.\r\n\r\nWhy you’ll love this apartment:\r\n\r\n* End-unit position for added privacy and extra windows\r\n* Light, airy interiors with excellent natural light \r\n* A well sized balcony overlooks the park with a peak of the sea\r\n* Double glazed throughout for comfort and efficiency\r\n* Two well-proportioned bedrooms\r\n* One modern, well-maintained bathroom\r\n* Two car parks included\r\n* Nearby lift access to the ground floor\r\n* Immaculate condition - one owner since new\r\n\r\nWhether you are entering the property ladder, downsizing, or just simply wanting something in an amazing location, this one will be hard to beat.\r\n\r\n*Note - images have been virtually staged*",
